The checkout story

Write a story called `checkout`: the `Web app` sends `POST /checkout` to the
`API`, the `API` makes the order in `Orders` with the label `create`, then
`Orders` asks `Payments` with the label `charge`. Show it as a sequence.
---
story checkout {
  Web app -> API: POST /checkout
  API -> Orders: create
  Orders -> Payments: charge
}
show sequence of checkout
